ntum just crossed down; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); investor cycle overdue; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -7.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum just crossed down; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); investor cycle overdue; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 30 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 15d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): downtrend. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (15d ago)", "Still below the 10-day average", "Daily momentum ~10 bars from turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "AVOID", "tag_zh": "\u56de\u907f", "urgency": "avoid", "text": "Downtrend \u2014 stand aside until a new cycle low forms and confirms.", "text_zh": "\u4e0b\u8dcc\u8d8b\u52bf\u2014\u2014\u89c2\u671b\uff0c\u76f4\u81f3\u65b0\u7684\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u5f62\u6210\u5e76\u786e\u8ba4\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 32 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "approaching the window where lows usually form", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 32 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u63a5\u8fd1\u4f4e\u70b9\u901a\u5e38\u5f62\u6210\u7684\u65f6\u95f4\u7a97\u53e3", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 30 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "overdue \u2014 the bigger cycle is stretched, expect more volatility", "weekly_line_zh": "\u5468\u7ebf\uff08\u6295\u8d44\u8005\uff09\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 30 \u5468\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 16\u201326 \u5468", "weekly_phase_zh": "\u903e\u671f\u2014\u2014\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u5468\u671f\u5df2\u88ab\u